      "description": "Tccd1 is the die running the inference cores (0-7); Tccd2 runs the RAG stack (8-15). Tctl is omitted: on a 5950X it is identical to Tdie, carrying no fan-control offset. Raw Zen 3 CCD sensors swing several degrees at idle, so read trends, not spot values.",
